    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-Create Hotel Rooms Hold-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Hold Hotel Room API enables businesses to temporarily reserve hotel rooms for customers, ensuring availability during the booking process. Users can initiate room holds, which are particularly useful for travel agencies and hospitality management systems. This API allows seamless interaction with room inventory and provides a way to manage reservations effectively. Typical consumers include hotels looking to enhance customer experiences by allowing holds without immediate payment, and travel platforms requiring flexible booking options for users.",
